1
00:02:31,017 --> 00:02:37,017
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:37,017 --> 00:02:41,017
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:41,017 --> 00:02:45,017
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:45,017 --> 00:02:50,017
Hunky D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:50,017 --> 00:02:53,017
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:53,017 --> 00:02:56,017
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:56,017 --> 00:02:59,017
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:59,017 --> 00:03:02,017
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:04,017 --> 00:03:06,017
This is exciting!

10
00:03:06,017 --> 00:03:09,017
I can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:09,017 --> 00:03:12,017
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:12,017 --> 00:03:17,017
the crew will come a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:20,017 --> 00:03:22,017
Separated from the rest of his crew,

14
00:03:22,017 --> 00:03:24,017
Luffy has rushed to Marineford

15
00:03:24,017 --> 00:03:28,017
and straight into the epic battle between the Navy and the Whitebeard Pirates.

16
00:03:28,017 --> 00:03:32,017
But will his new alliance be enough to save Ace from execution?

17
00:03:32,017 --> 00:03:34,017
Attention all ships and soldiers!

18
00:03:34,017 --> 00:03:36,017
Once all soldiers are in place,

19
00:03:36,017 --> 00:03:39,017
we will move the schedule forward and execute Ace immediately!

20
00:03:39,017 --> 00:03:40,017
That is all!

21
00:03:40,017 --> 00:03:41,017
Kolic!

22
00:03:43,017 --> 00:03:44,017
Luffy, no!

23
00:03:44,017 --> 00:03:45,017
Let's move!

24
00:03:47,017 --> 00:03:49,017
Let's go!

25
00:03:49,017 --> 00:03:54,017
Wait a minute!

26
00:03:54,017 --> 00:03:55,017
No!

27
00:03:55,017 --> 00:03:57,017
That's the wrong side!

28
00:03:57,017 --> 00:03:59,017
Ah, ahhhhhhh!

29
00:04:02,017 --> 00:04:16,017
Ahhhh!

30
00:04:16,017 --> 00:04:18,017
nurghh!

31
00:04:18,017 --> 00:04:24,017
AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH, I'M HEEEEEEEEEEEDR!!!

32
00:04:24,017 --> 00:04:24,857
Here!

33
00:04:27,637 --> 00:04:29,797
Hey, is that who I think it is?

34
00:04:29,797 --> 00:04:31,277
It's Crocodile.

35
00:04:31,277 --> 00:04:32,957
And he's not the only one either.

36
00:04:32,957 --> 00:04:34,837
Just take a look at that lineup.

37
00:04:34,837 --> 00:04:36,777
Who's who on both sides.

38
00:04:36,777 --> 00:04:38,537
All the big names are here.

39
00:04:38,537 --> 00:04:41,637
The world can't handle this madness.

40
00:04:42,797 --> 00:04:45,277
Hey Ace, sit tight, okay?

41
00:04:45,277 --> 00:04:48,677
Cause we're gonna get you out of here.

42
00:04:48,677 --> 00:04:52,197
Hey God, your family's messing things up again.

43
00:04:52,197 --> 00:04:54,077
Luffy, no!

44
00:04:54,077 --> 00:04:56,957
The grandson of our very own marine hero, Garp.

45
00:04:56,957 --> 00:04:59,737
And the son of the revolutionary dragon.

46
00:05:02,257 --> 00:05:03,977
I'll make that boy regret the day

47
00:05:03,977 --> 00:05:05,757
he decided to become a pirate.

48
00:05:07,377 --> 00:05:08,957
Where'd Crocoboy go?

49
00:05:08,957 --> 00:05:09,877
Huh?

50
00:05:09,877 --> 00:05:11,297
I guess the sucker chickened out

51
00:05:11,297 --> 00:05:13,437
and left us high and dry.

52
00:05:13,437 --> 00:05:14,577
Wait, there he is!

53
00:05:16,197 --> 00:05:19,417
Damn that, you're supposed to wait for me!

54
00:05:19,417 --> 00:05:22,657
Long time no see, old man.

55
00:05:22,657 --> 00:05:24,917
You'll never learn.

56
00:05:37,297 --> 00:05:40,097
You know, there's only one reason I'm here.

57
00:05:40,097 --> 00:05:43,597
If you wanna save your brother so bad, stay out of my way.

58
00:05:43,597 --> 00:05:46,197
I'm killing Whitebeard and you can't stop me.

59
00:05:46,197 --> 00:05:48,757
So that old guy is Whitebeard, I thought so.

60
00:05:48,757 --> 00:05:50,537
Just stay away from him!

61
00:05:50,537 --> 00:05:53,537
He's Ace's friend so I'm not gonna let him get hurt!

62
00:05:53,537 --> 00:05:55,097
Well, would you look at that.

63
00:05:55,097 --> 00:05:56,977
It runs in the family.

64
00:05:56,977 --> 00:05:59,637
You came here to rescue your big brother?

65
00:05:59,637 --> 00:06:00,637
That's right.

66
00:06:00,637 --> 00:06:03,997
Do you have the slightest idea who our forces are up against?

67
00:06:03,997 --> 00:06:10,997
A squirt like you is gonna get slaughtered real easy.

68
00:06:13,997 --> 00:06:14,997
Shut up!

69
00:06:14,997 --> 00:06:16,997
You don't know, you don't even know me!

70
00:06:16,997 --> 00:06:19,997
