71
00:06:19,997 --> 00:06:21,997
Yeah, you wanna be the king, huh?

72
00:06:21,997 --> 00:06:24,997
First you gotta go through me!

73
00:06:24,997 --> 00:06:25,997
Got it!

74
00:06:25,997 --> 00:06:26,997
Got it!

75
00:06:26,997 --> 00:06:27,997
Got it!

76
00:06:27,997 --> 00:06:28,997
Got it!

77
00:06:28,997 --> 00:06:41,997
What a cheeky little punk.

78
00:06:41,997 --> 00:06:46,997
Don't come crying to me for help if you get a few boo-boos, spoiled brat.

79
00:06:46,997 --> 00:06:47,997
Yeah, right!

80
00:06:47,997 --> 00:06:49,997
