85
00:07:06,997 --> 00:07:08,997
Hey, it's Luffy!

86
00:07:08,997 --> 00:07:11,997
He's that famous rookie with the straw hat!

87
00:07:11,997 --> 00:07:14,997
Does he have a connection to Whitebeard that we don't know of?

88
00:07:14,997 --> 00:07:15,997
Damn, he's stupid!

89
00:07:15,997 --> 00:07:17,997
Who breaks out of the world's greatest prison

90
00:07:17,997 --> 00:07:19,997
then goes straight to Navy HQ?

91
00:07:19,997 --> 00:07:23,997
Geez, if I were him, I'd be hiding under my bed right now!

92
00:07:23,997 --> 00:07:25,997
He's not stupid, he's Luffy.

93
00:07:25,997 --> 00:07:26,997
Huh?

94
00:07:26,997 --> 00:07:28,997
This is the only way he knows.

95
00:07:32,997 --> 00:07:33,997
Luffy.

96
00:07:33,997 --> 00:07:34,997
Pops!

97
00:07:36,997 --> 00:07:37,997
Straw hat, eh?

98
00:07:37,997 --> 00:07:39,997
He's just like his brother.

99
00:07:41,997 --> 00:07:42,997
Old man!

100
00:07:42,997 --> 00:07:46,997
I heard something on that Navy ship I think you should know!

101
00:07:46,997 --> 00:07:48,997
Look at this bonehead!

102
00:07:48,997 --> 00:07:50,997
Why doesn't Whitebeard just kick his ass?

103
00:07:50,997 --> 00:07:51,997
Get on with it!

104
00:07:51,997 --> 00:07:53,997
He is fearless, isn't he?

105
00:07:53,997 --> 00:07:55,997
Truly his father's son.

106
00:07:55,997 --> 00:07:59,997
They're throwing out the schedule for an immediate execution.

107
00:07:59,997 --> 00:08:01,997
Are you positive that's what you heard them say?

108
00:08:01,997 --> 00:08:04,997
Yeah, they said they gotta get all set for something first, though.

109
00:08:04,997 --> 00:08:07,997
But I don't know what for, cause they were using codes.

110
00:08:07,997 --> 00:08:10,997
I think you wanna rescue Ace as bad as me.

111
00:08:10,997 --> 00:08:12,997
And that's why I'm telling you.

112
00:08:12,997 --> 00:08:14,997
Well, alright.

113
00:08:14,997 --> 00:08:17,997
I suppose it's lucky I ran into you then.

114
00:08:17,997 --> 00:08:18,997
Thanks, kiddo.

115
00:08:18,997 --> 00:08:19,997
Sure thing.

116
00:08:19,997 --> 00:08:20,997
No big deal.

117
00:08:21,997 --> 00:08:23,997
Now he's talking like they're equals!

118
00:08:23,997 --> 00:08:25,997
That boy has got some serious balls!

119
00:08:25,997 --> 00:08:26,997
Right!

120
00:08:27,997 --> 00:08:29,997
Hang on Ace, I'm on my way!

121
00:08:29,997 --> 00:08:30,997
