122
00:08:30,997 --> 00:08:31,997
Gump Gump!

123
00:08:31,997 --> 00:08:32,997
Bazooka!

124
00:08:32,997 --> 00:08:45,997
Get out of my way!

125
00:08:45,997 --> 00:08:47,997
Well, he's Ace's brother alright.

126
00:08:47,997 --> 00:08:49,997
Third Division, let's get moving!

127
00:08:49,997 --> 00:08:52,997
Keep up with the boy and try to follow his lead.

128
00:08:52,997 --> 00:08:55,997
Let's lend our support!

129
00:08:55,997 --> 00:08:56,997
What?

130
00:08:58,997 --> 00:08:59,997
Come on!

131
00:08:59,997 --> 00:09:04,997
14th Division!

132
00:09:04,997 --> 00:09:05,997
Let's clear a path!

133
00:09:05,997 --> 00:09:07,997
We're right behind you, boss!

134
00:09:11,997 --> 00:09:12,997
Luffy.

135
00:09:13,997 --> 00:09:15,997
One rookie daredevil suddenly takes the lead

136
00:09:15,997 --> 00:09:17,997
and they're acting like a whole new army.

137
00:09:18,997 --> 00:09:19,997
Not that it matters.

138
00:09:19,997 --> 00:09:20,997
