148
00:09:44,997 --> 00:09:46,997
Straw Hat told me.

149
00:09:46,997 --> 00:09:48,997
Our squad and the others.

150
00:09:48,997 --> 00:09:51,997
They're tangled up pretty tight with the Vice Admirals at the head of the bay.

151
00:09:51,997 --> 00:09:54,997
I was just about to fly over there and lend him a helping hand.

152
00:09:54,997 --> 00:09:56,997
No, wait. Not yet.

153
00:09:56,997 --> 00:10:00,997
Something in my gut tells me Sengoku wanted us to get that leaked info.

154
00:10:00,997 --> 00:10:02,997
He wants us to advance.

155
00:10:02,997 --> 00:10:03,997
Huh?

156
00:10:03,997 --> 00:10:07,997
That old bastard's too clever to let his strategy get out.

157
00:10:07,997 --> 00:10:09,997
Not that easily at least.

158
00:10:09,997 --> 00:10:11,997
