161
00:10:22,997 --> 00:10:24,997
Did you think I was gonna let you pass?

162
00:10:24,997 --> 00:10:27,997
You fellas are awfully confident for a bunch of nobodies.

163
00:10:27,997 --> 00:10:28,997
Damn!

164
00:10:28,997 --> 00:10:29,997
