178
00:11:10,997 --> 00:11:11,997
Right?

179
00:11:11,997 --> 00:11:12,997
So we can go home?

180
00:11:13,997 --> 00:11:15,997
Yeah, these Admirals aren't so tough.

181
00:11:15,997 --> 00:11:18,997
All in a day's work for Captain Buggy!

182
00:11:19,997 --> 00:11:20,997
