183
00:11:20,997 --> 00:11:21,997
Would you quit enabling him?

184
00:11:21,997 --> 00:11:23,997
Are you still breathing, Straw Boy?

185
00:11:24,997 --> 00:11:25,997
You bet!

186
00:11:25,997 --> 00:11:26,997
Thanks, Eva!

187
00:11:26,997 --> 00:11:27,997
See ya!

188
00:11:27,997 --> 00:11:28,997
See ya?

189
00:11:28,997 --> 00:11:31,997
Do you realize the only reason I'm here is to save your rubber bot?

190
00:11:32,997 --> 00:11:33,997
Damn, Kizaru.

191
00:11:34,997 --> 00:11:35,997
Huh?

192
00:11:35,997 --> 00:11:36,997
