Now...

230
00:12:24,997 --> 00:12:25,997
Let's do this!

231
00:12:25,997 --> 00:12:50,117
Sorry, but your luck got away from you when you ran into us.

232
00:12:50,757 --> 00:12:54,837
Well, Straw Hat, might as well lie down because this is where you die.

233
00:12:55,997 --> 00:12:57,237
Do I know you?

234
00:12:57,757 --> 00:12:59,477
Ha! I'm full-body!

235
00:13:00,217 --> 00:13:03,937
I've been waiting a long time to make you pay for what happened at the Baratier.

236
00:13:04,617 --> 00:13:06,857
Oh, right. Sanji kicked your ass there.

237
00:13:07,797 --> 00:13:11,117
This chakram. I'm sure it'll ring a few bells for you.

238
00:13:11,317 --> 00:13:15,597
Yeah, you're the hypno guy from Usopp's village. What are you doing with these guys?

239
00:13:16,217 --> 00:13:20,537
I joined the Navy to hone my skills, and I've mastered the art of hypnotism.

240
00:13:21,217 --> 00:13:23,917
It's twice as effective yielding two chakrams.

241
00:13:23,917 --> 00:13:27,257
When I say one, two, Django, you'll fall into a deep sleep.

242
00:13:27,637 --> 00:13:31,037
One, two, Django!

243
00:13:39,677 --> 00:13:41,237
Worthless sacks of crap.

244
00:13:44,757 --> 00:13:46,057
So disappointing.

245
00:13:46,057 --> 00:13:51,617
You're that cage chick from Alabaster, right? I don't have time to play games with you people!

246
00:13:52,137 --> 00:13:53,717
I never play games.

247
00:13:53,917 --> 00:13:55,577
Come on, Oslee, cage!

248
00:13:59,257 --> 00:14:03,817
Anyone who tries to pass through me will be bound by the bars of my black cage.

249
00:14:04,197 --> 00:14:08,057
I love it when she uses that line, Captain Hina's the essence of captivating.

250
00:14:08,057 --> 00:14:10,777
I'm done spending time behind bars!

251
00:14:10,977 --> 00:14:12,477
Now, second gear!

252
00:14:18,517 --> 00:14:20,537
