256
00:14:28,937 --> 00:14:37,657
Don't take on the Vice-Admirals alone!

257
00:14:37,897 --> 00:14:39,397
They're too strong for one man!

258
00:14:41,777 --> 00:14:43,137
Hey, Captain Squart!

259
00:14:43,537 --> 00:14:45,817
Looks like things are getting ugly inside the bay!

260
00:14:45,937 --> 00:14:46,717
