261
00:14:47,457 --> 00:14:50,017
I gotta get to Ace fast before it gets worse.

262
00:14:51,077 --> 00:14:53,517
At least Orr's opened up a path for me.

263
00:14:53,517 --> 00:14:57,297
There's a good chance I can outspot him if I sneak in through here.

264
00:14:58,797 --> 00:14:59,097
Huh?

265
00:15:02,997 --> 00:15:03,637
Huh?

266
00:15:07,597 --> 00:15:09,197
I know you.

267
00:15:23,517 --> 00:15:49,537
Why do they all have to be so strong?

268
00:15:49,537 --> 00:15:50,317
Ah!

269
