He's as high-spirited as ever I see.

272
00:16:07,377 --> 00:16:08,037
Oh, yeah.

273
00:16:08,697 --> 00:16:12,557
I can cut off his shadow again and then plant it inside the new zombie.

274
00:16:16,217 --> 00:16:17,997
Rise, my zombie soldiers!

275
00:16:17,997 --> 00:16:19,117
It's time!

276
00:16:19,537 --> 00:16:29,317
Now then, are you listening?

277
00:16:29,697 --> 00:16:30,037
Good!

278
00:16:30,257 --> 00:16:31,997
Capture Straw Hat and bring him to me.

279
00:16:32,117 --> 00:16:33,357
I want him alive!

280
00:16:33,877 --> 00:16:34,977
Stupid Moria!

281
00:16:35,317 --> 00:16:37,357
I don't want to deal with that creep now!

282
00:16:37,357 --> 00:16:54,137
You keep up!

283
00:16:54,137 --> 00:16:59,697
There are more of them!

284
00:16:59,697 --> 00:17:01,757
There are more of them!

285
00:17:01,757 --> 00:17:02,677
Of course!

286
00:17:02,837 --> 00:17:04,317
We are standing on a battlefield.

287
00:17:04,717 --> 00:17:08,277
I've got plenty of fresh corpses gathered about to pick and choose from.

288
00:17:08,697 --> 00:17:10,057
Capture Straw Hat Luffy!

289
00:17:10,217 --> 00:17:12,117
He's the one that caused that jailbreak!

290
00:17:12,497 --> 00:17:13,257
That's right.

291
00:17:13,377 --> 00:17:14,037
Keep going.

292
00:17:15,217 --> 00:17:17,797
This should be enough officers to keep the kid busy.

293
00:17:18,497 --> 00:17:21,037
He can't keep bouncing around like that forever.

294
00:17:21,037 --> 00:17:22,037
Luffy!

295
00:17:22,037 --> 00:17:23,037
Luffy!

296
00:17:23,037 --> 00:17:24,037
Luffy!

297
00:17:24,037 --> 00:17:25,037
Luffy!

298
00:17:25,037 --> 00:17:39,037
Stay back!

299
00:17:39,037 --> 00:18:05,437
What the hell do you think you're doing?

300
00:18:05,437 --> 00:18:08,377
You became a pirate because I wanted to!

301
00:18:08,697 --> 00:18:11,377
You only went to sea because you were following me!

302
00:18:11,557 --> 00:18:14,277
But I've got my own damn life without you in it!

303
00:18:14,917 --> 00:18:17,677
I've already got enough of my own friends!

304
00:18:19,757 --> 00:18:20,437
Ace...

305
00:18:20,437 --> 00:18:21,797
You get it?

306
00:18:22,077 --> 00:18:24,817
I want you to stay the hell away from me!

307
00:18:25,437 --> 00:18:27,217
You really want to save me?

308
00:18:27,477 --> 00:18:28,937
A scrawny whip like you?

309
00:18:28,937 --> 00:18:29,217
Luffy!

310
00:18:29,637 --> 00:18:32,737
What makes you think I'd even want something like that, huh?

311
00:18:33,097 --> 00:18:34,857
That's just humiliating!

312
00:18:35,517 --> 00:18:36,857
Go home, Luffy!

313
00:18:37,457 --> 00:18:39,277
I didn't ask for this!

314
00:18:41,577 --> 00:18:42,617
I'm begging you.

315
00:18:43,137 --> 00:18:43,617
Please.

316
00:18:44,017 --> 00:18:45,917
I can't let you die here with me.

317
00:18:47,737 --> 00:18:48,997
It's my fault.

318
00:18:48,997 --> 00:18:49,437
It's...

319
00:18:49,437 --> 00:18:51,357
It's all my fault.

320
00:18:53,937 --> 00:18:54,577
Ace!

321
00:18:55,577 --> 00:18:56,937
You're my brother!

322
00:19:04,277 --> 00:19:05,377
It's the truth.

323
00:19:05,937 --> 00:19:07,537
All it takes to become brothers

324
00:19:07,537 --> 00:19:09,757
is to share some sake.

325
00:19:11,817 --> 00:19:13,037
From here on out,

326
00:19:13,117 --> 00:19:14,457
we're honest-to-goodness brothers.

327
00:19:14,457 --> 00:19:25,737
Did I just hear them say that they're brothers?

328
00:19:26,037 --> 00:19:27,837
So then he's also Roger's son?

329
00:19:28,017 --> 00:19:30,777
But both of Ace's parents were dead when he was born.

330
00:19:31,097 --> 00:19:32,497
That can be possible, can't it?

331
00:19:32,497 --> 00:19:36,137
I don't give a damn what you want!

332
00:19:36,357 --> 00:19:38,317
I'm here to save you!

333
00:19:38,457 --> 00:19:39,777
You stubborn jackass!

334
00:19:43,077 --> 00:19:44,837
Move out, zombie soldiers!

335
00:19:44,997 --> 00:19:46,037
Attack and capture!

336
00:19:46,037 --> 00:19:55,657
Seawater!

337
00:19:55,657 --> 00:19:55,697
Seawater!

338
00:19:59,537 --> 00:19:59,937
Jinbei!

339
00:20:00,437 --> 00:20:02,417
They came from devil fruit powers,

340
00:20:02,817 --> 00:20:05,037
and thus, they are weak to the sea.

341
00:20:06,337 --> 00:20:07,217
Press on.

342
00:20:07,397 --> 00:20:09,317
These zombies will prove no match for me.

343
00:20:09,317 --> 00:20:10,037
Okay, if you're sure.

344
00:20:10,197 --> 00:20:11,617
First son of the sea, Jinbei.

345
00:20:11,777 --> 00:20:13,077
We've got to fight a warlord.

346
00:20:13,177 --> 00:20:16,357
You're making a mockery of the Navy

347
00:20:16,357 --> 00:20:18,977
by letting this rookie take control of things!

348
00:20:19,117 --> 00:20:19,957
Let me at him.

349
00:20:20,797 --> 00:20:23,057
I'll crush this squirt into paste.

350
00:20:24,737 --> 00:20:30,217
Make no mistake,

351
00:20:30,397 --> 00:20:31,917
he's a tooth-thread in the making.

352
00:20:32,477 --> 00:20:35,037
He was raised alongside Firefist Ace

353
00:20:35,037 --> 00:20:36,097
as his stepbrother.

354
00:20:36,577 --> 00:20:37,957
And if that's not bad enough,

355
00:20:37,957 --> 00:20:39,797
he's the biological son

356
00:20:39,797 --> 00:20:41,617
of the revolutionary dragon!

357
00:20:42,137 --> 00:20:43,917
Did he just say what I think he said?

358
00:20:43,997 --> 00:20:45,877
He's the son of the worst criminal in history!

359
00:20:46,317 --> 00:20:48,677
Makes you think twice about who you punch, huh?

360
00:20:48,837 --> 00:20:51,077
Why didn't anyone tell me that's his dad?

361
00:20:51,197 --> 00:20:52,217
Now they know!

362
00:20:52,937 --> 00:20:53,737
Oh, man!

363
00:20:56,177 --> 00:20:56,657
Luffy,

364
00:20:57,177 --> 00:20:58,697
it wouldn't bother me

365
00:20:58,697 --> 00:21:00,317
if your father was the devil himself.

366
00:21:04,237 --> 00:21:05,837
I had no idea.

367
00:21:05,837 --> 00:21:07,597
Well, damn.

368
00:21:08,177 --> 00:21:08,797
Okay!

369
00:21:09,917 --> 00:21:11,237
Gum-gum pistol!

370
00:21:14,177 --> 00:21:23,737
I finally understand

371
00:21:23,737 --> 00:21:25,177
what happened at Log Town.

372
00:21:26,017 --> 00:21:27,077
It only makes sense

373
00:21:27,077 --> 00:21:29,097
that dragon would save his own son.

374
00:21:29,237 --> 00:21:30,537
Did you hear what he just said?

375
00:21:30,537 --> 00:21:33,937
Does he mean the dragon?

376
00:21:34,177 --> 00:21:34,657
Head office!

377
00:21:34,997 --> 00:21:35,857
Can you hear me?

378
00:21:36,117 --> 00:21:37,377
I'm calling from Sabaody!

379
00:21:37,657 --> 00:21:38,877
I've got huge news!

380
00:21:39,077 --> 00:21:41,097
We're talking worldwide headlines here!

381
00:21:41,837 --> 00:21:44,157
I guess we'll just have to kill him, too!

382
00:21:44,877 --> 00:21:46,797
I can't let him survive!

383
00:21:48,177 --> 00:21:49,277
Who cares?

384
00:21:49,677 --> 00:21:51,657
There's no reason to hide it any longer.

385
00:21:52,117 --> 00:21:54,657
And it's not like it's gonna make his life any worse

386
00:21:54,657 --> 00:21:56,837
since he's already a notorious outlaw.

387
00:21:58,837 --> 00:22:01,417
You two brothers are both damn fools.

388
00:22:02,417 --> 00:22:03,297
Dirt gear!

389
00:22:11,217 --> 00:22:12,837
Gum-gum-gum!

390
00:22:13,997 --> 00:22:14,997
Giant!

391
00:22:16,997 --> 00:22:17,417
Ripple!

392
00:22:17,417 --> 00:22:18,077
Ripple!

393
00:22:27,437 --> 00:22:28,017
Ice!

394
00:22:28,017 --> 00:22:28,357
Ace!

395
00:22:31,877 --> 00:22:34,297
Say whatever mean stuff you want!

396
00:22:34,437 --> 00:22:36,217
I'm still gonna save you!

397
00:22:38,897 --> 00:22:40,097
Oh, hell yeah.

398
00:22:40,537 --> 00:22:42,757
Your brother speaks for every one of us, Ace.

399
00:22:42,757 --> 00:22:44,897
Yeah, we're all a part of your family, too.

400
00:22:45,037 --> 00:22:46,677
And nothing's gonna stop us.

401
00:22:46,677 --> 00:22:51,677
Hey, Marco, don't let that kid die no matter what.

402
00:22:51,677 --> 00:22:53,677
You got it.

403
00:22:59,677 --> 00:23:01,677
Luffy.

404
00:23:01,677 --> 00:23:18,677
As Ace watches helplessly while the battle unfolds before him, he comes to an important decision, though he's unable to act.

405
00:23:18,677 --> 00:23:24,677
Meanwhile, a flurry of friends, foes, and fantastic powers explodes on the battlefield.

406
00:23:24,677 --> 00:23:31,677
On the next, One Piece, hard battles, one after another, Devil Fruit Eaters versus Devil Fruit Eaters.

407
00:23:31,677 --> 00:23:33,677
I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!

